	(text "PicoGUS NE2000: v1.2 ISA interface unchanged.\nRemoved: audio (DAC, Waveblaster, mixer), MIDI out,\nISA DMA (DRQ/DACK/TC - the NE2000 uses programmed I/O)\nand the USB power jumper.\nGPIO16-20 + 22: boot ROM set-up (sheet 2).\nTP2/TP3: Pico W USB D-/D+ -> USB-A port (sheet 2)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 223.52 96.52 0)
